    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 485,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Selene Vigil-Wilk\nSelene Here Vigil-Wilk ( born July 16 , 1965 ) is an American singer and musician . She co-founded grunge band 7 Year Bitch alongside Elizabeth Davis , Valerie Agnew and Stefanie Sargent in 1990 ; they released three studio albums before disbanding in 1997 . In 2000 , Vigil formed a gothic band , Cistine . In 2010 , Vigil released her debut solo album , That Was Then . Vigil was married to Rage Against the Machine 's drummer , Brad Wilk . They have two children ."
     }
